`benchmark.meta description: Measures temporary-root shim call overhead with zero roots.
`benchmark.meta timing: recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: temporary-roots

/BxCore/BxCore.h

. pointer = "temporary-root-shim-zero"
. root-count = 0
. iterations = 4000000

C:brixBenchTemporaryRootShim(pointer, root-count, 1)
C:brixBenchResetTemporaryRootMetrics()
. checksum = C:brixBenchTemporaryRootShim(pointer, root-count, iterations)

-- "bench-result gc/temporary-root-shim-zero checksum=$checksum"
